<Legal title="Free first question terms" h1="Terms for the free first question" description="The terms for your free first question: what we access, what you get, and what we never do with it." path="/free-report-terms">
  <ul>
    <li>The first question is free. No card, no contract, no obligation to buy anything.</li>
    <li>We only use what you share to answer your question.</li>
    <li>You keep the slides and can share them with anyone.</li>
    <li>We never publish your answer, name or numbers. If we ever want to show it anonymized as an example, we’ll ask first, in writing, and you can say no.</li>
    <li>[Confirm: what happens to access and data after the report is delivered.]</li>
    <li>[Counsel to review.]</li>
  </ul>
</Legal>
